{"3381300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Steam & Iron. Battle of Port Arthur", "steam_appid": 3381300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381300/extras/fb013dad70cfa2ed8628ed8193b89a0a.poster.avif?t=1788251092\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381300/extras/fb013dad70cfa2ed8628ed8193b89a0a.webm?t=1788251092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381300/extras/fb013dad70cfa2ed8628ed8193b89a0a.mp4?t=1788251092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam &amp; Iron: Battle of Port Arthur</strong> is a real-time naval simulator set in the era of early 20th-century steamships. Step into the shoes of Japanese Admiral Heihachiro Togo aboard his flagship battleship <i>Mikasa</i> and lead your fleet into battle against the Russian navy’s formidable squadrons of battleships, cruisers, and torpedo boats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our game faithfully simulates naval engagements between individual ships and fleets in the Yellow Sea during the Japanese Navy’s siege of the Russian naval base at Port Arthur.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through ready-made missions or create your own using a built-in editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features ships from the Russian First Pacific Squadron and the Japanese Navy (Nippon Kaigun).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical naval combat is carefully simulated, factoring in ship positioning, speed, sea conditions, fire and flood control systems, and accuracy adjustments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather conditions, sea states, and time of day directly affect combat dynamics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All ships are based on real historical prototypes with accurate technical specifications.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes dozens of military and civilian ships from both fleets, with more being added over time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381300/extras/5e38ed83f5eb0c292ca85e51e664ff5e.poster.avif?t=1788251092\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381300/extras/5e38ed83f5eb0c292ca85e51e664ff5e.webm?t=1788251092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381300/extras/5e38ed83f5eb0c292ca85e51e664ff5e.mp4?t=1788251092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic campaign for the battles in the Yellow Sea for both sides.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save and load functionality during missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naval operations in other theaters (e.g., Vladivostok, Tsushima).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New ships.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381300/extras/fb013dad70cfa2ed8628ed8193b89a0a.poster.avif?t=1788251092\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381300/extras/fb013dad70cfa2ed8628ed8193b89a0a.webm?t=1788251092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381300/extras/fb013dad70cfa2ed8628ed8193b89a0a.mp4?t=1788251092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam &amp; Iron: Battle of Port Arthur</strong> is a real-time naval simulator set in the era of early 20th-century steamships. Step into the shoes of Japanese Admiral Heihachiro Togo aboard his flagship battleship <i>Mikasa</i> and lead your fleet into battle against the Russian navy’s formidable squadrons of battleships, cruisers, and torpedo boats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our game faithfully simulates naval engagements between individual ships and fleets in the Yellow Sea during the Japanese Navy’s siege of the Russian naval base at Port Arthur.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through ready-made missions or create your own using a built-in editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features ships from the Russian First Pacific Squadron and the Japanese Navy (Nippon Kaigun).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical naval combat is carefully simulated, factoring in ship positioning, speed, sea conditions, fire and flood control systems, and accuracy adjustments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather conditions, sea states, and time of day directly affect combat dynamics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All ships are based on real historical prototypes with accurate technical specifications.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes dozens of military and civilian ships from both fleets, with more being added over time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381300/extras/5e38ed83f5eb0c292ca85e51e664ff5e.poster.avif?t=1788251092\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381300/extras/5e38ed83f5eb0c292ca85e51e664ff5e.webm?t=1788251092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381300/extras/5e38ed83f5eb0c292ca85e51e664ff5e.mp4?t=1788251092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic campaign for the battles in the Yellow Sea for both sides.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save and load functionality during missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naval operations in other theaters (e.g., Vladivostok, Tsushima).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New ships.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Steam &amp; Iron: Battle of Port Arthur is a tactical real-time naval simulator focusing on the combat of early 20th-century steamships. Squadrons of battleships, cruisers, and torpedo boats from two empires await your command to clash in epic naval battles.", "supported_languages": "English, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381300/header.jpg?t=1788251092", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381300/0882be3eded12c2efb910be867072d3d8a4390b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788251092", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381300/0882be3eded12c2efb910be867072d3d8a4390b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788251092", "website": "https://www.steamandirongame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600T 2.30GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 960 2GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>